>wilayah</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>0</th>\n      <td>ae70c952-83f1-4102-83e3-24d79fc75d02</td>\n      <td>H1mh chanel</td>\n      <td>g kepake. masak gunung putri gda. apa udah g d...</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>2026-06-09 15:02:03</td>\n      <td>Bogor Single Window (Asinan Bogor)</td>\n      <td>Kota Bogor</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>1</th>\n      <td>abbaa84f-8453-4657-a088-1d11d1359292</td>\n      <td>Doni</td>\n      <td>ad ny asinan bogor pengurusan lebih praktis</td>\n      <td>5</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>2026-05-11 06:56:56</td>\n      <td>Bogor Single Window (Asinan Bogor)</td>\n      <td>Kota Bogor</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>2</th>\n      <td>b73a5d0c-9484-4218-9282-7756b49eb93f</td>\n      <td>Egoy Kabir</td>\n      <td>sangat tidak membantu</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>0</td>\n      <td>2026-04-25 07:24:43</td>\n      <td>Bogor Single Window (Asinan Bogor)</td>\n      <td>Kota Bogor</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":2},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"---\n## 🧹 TAHAP 4.2: Pembersihan Data (Text Preprocessing)\n**Sesuai Skripsi Subbab 4.2 (4.2.1 - 4.2.7):**  \n- **4.2.1 Cleaning**: Menghilangkan URL, mention (`@`), hashtag (`#`), angka, dan karakter spesial (tetap menjaga tanda emosi `!` dan `?`).\n- **4.2.2 Case Folding**: Mengubah seluruh huruf menjadi huruf kecil (*lowercase*).\n- **4.2.3 Tokenizing**: Pemisahan teks ulasan menjadi token-token kata.\n- **4.2.4 Normalisasi Slang**: Mengubah kata tidak baku menggunakan kamus slang *YotaGod* & preservasi InSet.\n- **4.2.5 Negasi Handling**: Menggabungkan penanda negasi (`tidak`, `bukan`, `belum`, `kurang`, `ga`, `gak`) dengan kata pembawa sentimen setelahnya agar makna konteks tidak hilang.\n- **4.2.6 Adaptasi BERT**: Menjaga kata berimbuhan agar *subword tokenizer* IndoBERT dapat mengekstrak konteks semantik secara sempurna tanpa stemming agresif.\n\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# Memuat Slang Dictionary\nSLANG_DICT = {}\nif os.path.exists(\"data/slang.csv\"):\n    df_slang = pd.read_csv(\"data/slang.csv\", sep=\";\")\n    if \"slang\" in df_slang.columns and \"formal\" in df_slang.columns:\n        for _, r in df_slang.iterrows():\n            if pd.notna(r[\"slang\"]):\n                SLANG_DICT[str(r[\"slang\"]).strip().lower()] = str(r[\"formal\"]).strip().lower() if pd.notna(r[\"formal\"]) else \"\"\n\n# Overwrite kata-kata kunci aplikasi & negasi agar sesuai leksikon InSet\nCUSTOM_SLANG = {\n    \"ga\": \"tidak\", \"gak\": \"tidak\", \"ngga\": \"tidak\", \"nggak\": \"tidak\", \"gk\": \"tidak\",\n    \"kagak\": \"tidak\", \"tdk\": \"tidak\", \"blm\": \"belum\", \"gbs\": \"tidak bisa\",\n    \"bgt\": \"banget\", \"lola\": \"lemot\", \"lelet\": \"lemot\", \"eror\": \"error\"\n}\nSLANG_DICT.update(CUSTOM_SLANG)\n\nNEGATION_WORDS = {\"tidak\", \"bukan\", \"belum\", \"kurang\", \"jangan\", \"ga\", \"gak\"}\n\ndef preprocess_text_skripsi(text: str) -> str:\n    if not isinstance(text, str) or not text.strip():\n        return \"\"\n    \n    # 4.2.2 Case Folding\n    text = text.lower()\n    \n    # 4.2.1 Cleaning (URL, mention, hashtag, karakter non-alfanumerik)\n    text = re.sub(r'https?://\\S+|www\\.\\S+', ' ', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'@\\w+', ' ', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'#\\w+', ' ', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'(.)\u0001{2,}', r'\u0001\u0001', text) # Normalisasi karakter berulang\n    text = re.sub(r'[^a-z0-9\\s!?]', ' ', text)\n    text = re.sub(r'([!?])', r' \u0001 ', text)\n    \n    # 4.2.3 Tokenizing & 4.2.4 Normalisasi Slang\n    words = text.split()\n    normalized = []\n    for w in words:\n        formal_w = SLANG_DICT.get(w, w)\n        if formal_w and formal_w.strip():\n            normalized.append(formal_w.strip())\n            \n    # 4.2.5 Negasi Handling (Penggabungan konteks negasi)\n    handled_tokens = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(normalized):\n        token = normalized[i]\n        if token in NEGATION_WORDS and (i + 1) < len(normalized):\n            next_token = normalized[i + 1]\n            handled_tokens.append(f\"{token}_{next_token}\")\n            i += 2\n        else:\n            handled_tokens.append(token)\n            i += 1\n            \n    clean_text = \" \".join(handled_tokens)\n    return re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', clean_text).strip()\n\n# Uji Coba Preprocessing\nsample_txt = \"Aplikasi JAKI lemot bgt euy! sering eror & force close pas mau antri RS... ga bs login!\"\nprint(\"Teks Asli   :\", sample_txt)\nprint(\"Hasil Preprocess Skripsi:\", preprocess_text_skripsi(sample_txt))\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-16T14:52:36.354588Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-16T14:52:36.354834Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.147474Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-16T14:52:36.354808Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.146686Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Teks Asli   : Aplikasi JAKI lemot bgt euy! sering eror & force close pas mau antri RS... ga bs login!\nHasil Preprocess Skripsi: aplikasi jaki lambat banget euy \u0001 sering error force close pada saat ingin antre rumah sakit tidak_bisa masuk \u0001\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":3},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"---\n## 📌 TAHAP 4.3: Klasifikasi Aspek (Aspect Classification)\n**Sesuai Skripsi Subbab 4.3:**  \nMengelompokkan ulasan ke dalam 5 dimensi kualitas layanan SPBE berdasarkan pembobotan *Evidence Scoring*:\n1. **Fungsionalitas** (Kelengkapan fitur, menu layanan publik, dokumen KTP/bansos)\n2. **Kinerja Aplikasi** (Kecepatan, *loading*, lemot, konsumsi daya/memori)\n3. **Kemudahan Penggunaan** (UI/UX, tampilan, navigasi, kemudahan awam)\n4. **Keandalan & Keamanan** (*Error*, *crash*, *bug*, login, OTP, privasi data)\n5. **Kualitas Layanan** (Responsif petugas/admin, penanganan aduan warga)\n\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"ASPECT_KEYWORDS = {\n    \"Kinerja Aplikasi\": [\"lemot\", \"lambat\", \"loading\", \"berat\", \"memori\", \"baterai\", \"cepat\", \"lancar\", \"ringan\", \"putus\"],\n    \"Fungsionalitas\": [\"fitur\", \"menu\", \"layanan\", \"update\", \"opsi\", \"tombol\", \"verifikasi\", \"data\", \"ktp\", \"bansos\"],\n    \"Kemudahan Penggunaan\": [\"mudah\", \"sulit\", \"ribet\", \"bingung\", \"simpel\", \"ui\", \"ux\", \"tampilan\", \"desain\", \"paham\"],\n    \"Keandalan & Keamanan\": [\"error\", \"eror\", \"bug\", \"crash\", \"keluar\", \"gagal\", \"login\", \"otp\", \"daftar\", \"keamanan\"],\n    \"Kualitas Layanan\": [\"admin\", \"petugas\", \"respon\", \"tanggapan\", \"laporan\", \"aduan\", \"ramah\", \"solusi\", \"proses\"]\n}\n\ndef classify_aspect(text: str):\n    text_clean = text.replace(\"_\", \" \").lower()\n    scores = {asp: 0 for asp in ASPECT_KEYWORDS}\n    \n    for asp, kw_list in ASPECT_KEYWORDS.items():\n        for kw in kw_list:\n            if re.search(r'\b' + re.escape(kw) + r'\b', text_clean):\n                scores[asp] += 1.0\n                \n    max_score = max(scores.values())\n    if max_score == 0:\n        return \"Fungsionalitas\", 0.50\n        \n    best_aspect = max(scores, key=scores.get)\n    confidence = min(0.95, 0.50 + (max_score * 0.15))\n    return best_aspect, confidence\n\nprint(\"Uji Aspek:\", classify_aspect(\"Aplikasi lambat banget dan sering keluar sendiri saat dibuka\"))\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.149322Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.149716Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.1605Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.149685Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.159592Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Uji Aspek: ('Fungsionalitas', 0.5)\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":4},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"---\n## 🏷️ TAHAP 4.4: Pelabelan Sentimen (Sentiment Labeling)\n**Sesuai Skripsi Subbab 4.4:**  \nMenghitung skor Polarisasi Sentimen menggunakan Leksikon InSet (*fajri91*) dipadukan dengan pengenalan negasi dan rating bintang ulasan.\n\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"pos_url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fajri91/InSet/refs/heads/master/positive.tsv\"\nneg_url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fajri91/InSet/refs/heads/master/negative.tsv\"\n\nurllib.request.urlretrieve(pos_url, \"data/positive.tsv\")\nurllib.request.urlretrieve(neg_url, \"data/negative.tsv\")\n\ndef load_inset_lexicon():\n    pos_dict, neg_dict = {}, {}\n    df_pos = pd.read_csv(\"data/positive.tsv\", sep=\"\t\")\n    df_neg = pd.read_csv(\"data/negative.tsv\", sep=\"\t\")\n    \n    for _, row in df_pos.iterrows():\n        word = str(row.iloc[0]).strip().lower()\n        if word and word != \"word\":\n            try: pos_dict[word] = float(row.iloc[1])\n            except: pass\n                \n    for _, row in df_neg.iterrows():\n        word = str(row.iloc[0]).strip().lower()\n        if word and word != \"word\":\n            try: neg_dict[word] = float(row.iloc[1])\n            except: pass\n                \n    return pos_dict, neg_dict\n\nPOS_LEX, NEG_LEX = load_inset_lexicon()\n\ndef calculate_inset_score(text: str) -> float:\n    words = text.lower().split()\n    total_score = 0.0\n    negation_active = False\n    \n    for word in words:\n        if \"_\" in word:\n            parts = word.split(\"_\")\n            if parts[0] in [\"tidak\", \"bukan\", \"belum\", \"kurang\", \"ga\", \"gak\"]:\n                w_target = parts[1]\n                w_score = POS_LEX.get(w_target, 0.0) if w_target in POS_LEX else NEG_LEX.get(w_target, 0.0)\n                total_score += -w_score * 1.2\n                continue\n                \n        if word in [\"tidak\", \"bukan\", \"belum\", \"kurang\", \"ga\", \"gak\"]:\n            negation_active = True\n            continue\n            \n        if word in POS_LEX: score = float(POS_LEX[word])\n        elif word in NEG_LEX: score = float(NEG_LEX[word])\n        else: score = 0.0\n        \n        if negation_active:\n            score = -score * 1.2\n            negation_active = False\n            \n        total_score += score\n    return total_score\n\nprint(\"Skor InSet 'tidak_bagus':\", calculate_inset_score(\"tidak_bagus\"))\nprint(\"Skor InSet 'sangat bagus':\", calculate_inset_score(\"sangat bagus\"))\n\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.1618Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.162186Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.987959Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.162149Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.987103Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Skor InSet 'tidak_bagus': -2.4\nSkor InSet 'sangat bagus': 5.0\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":5},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"---\n## 🤖 TAHAP 4.5: Modeling & Fine-Tuning IndoBERT Transformer\n**Sesuai Skripsi Subbab 4.5 (Pembaruan dari BiLSTM ke IndoBERT):**  \n- **Tokenisasi Subword IndoBERT**: Mengonversi teks ulasan menjadi `input_ids` dan `attention_mask` berukuran `max_len=128`.\n- **Stratified Split**: Pembagian data (80% Latih, 20% Uji) dengan menjaga keseimbangan kelas.\n- **Handling Data Imbalance**: Menggunakan *Class Weights* pada *CrossEntropyLoss*.\n- **Fine-Tuning Architecture**: Menggunakan arsitektur Pre-trained `indobenchmark/indobert-base-p1` dengan AdamW Optimizer dan Learning Rate Warmup.\n\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"MODEL_NAME = \"indobenchmark/indobert-base-p1\"\nSAVE_DIR = \"models/indobert_sentiment_model\"\nLABEL_MAP = {\"Negatif\": 0, \"Positif\": 1}\n\nclass ReviewDataset(Dataset):\n    def __init__(self, texts, labels, tokenizer, max_len=128):\n        self.texts = list(texts)\n        self.labels = list(labels)\n        self.tokenizer = tokenizer\n        self.max_len = max_len\n\n    def __len__(self):\n        return len(self.texts)\n\n    def __getitem__(self, idx):\n        text = str(self.texts[idx]).replace(\"_\", \" \")\n        label = self.labels[idx]\n        encoding = self.tokenizer(\n            text, truncation=True, max_length=self.max_len, padding=\"max_length\", return_tensors=\"pt\"\n        )\n        return {\n            \"input_ids\": encoding[\"input_ids\"].flatten(),\n            \"attention_mask\": encoding[\"attention_mask\"].flatten(),\n            \"labels\": torch.tensor(label, dtype=torch.long)\n        }\n\nclass EarlyStopping:\n    def __init__(self, patience=2, min_delta=0.001):\n        self.patience = patience\n        self.min_delta = min_delta\n        self.counter = 0\n        self.best_loss = None\n        self.early_stop = False\n\n    def __call__(self, val_loss):\n        if self.best_loss is None:\n            self.best_loss = val_loss\n            return True\n        elif val_loss < self.best_loss - self.min_delta:\n            self.best_loss = val_loss\n            self.counter = 0\n            return True\n        else:\n            self.counter += 1\n            if self.counter >= self.patience:\n                self.early_stop = True\n            return False\n\nif 'df_raw' in locals():\n    print(\"Memproses dataset lengkap untuk IndoBERT Training...\")\n    df_proc = df_raw.copy()\n    df_proc[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\"] = df_proc[\"teks_ulasan\"].apply(preprocess_text_skripsi)\n    df_proc = df_proc[df_proc[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\"].str.strip() != \"\"].reset_index(drop=True)\n    \n    # Aspek & Sentimen Labeling\n    df_proc[\"aspek_dominan\"] = df_proc[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\"].apply(lambda x: classify_aspect(x)[0])\n    df_proc[\"inset_score\"] = df_proc[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\"].apply(calculate_inset_score)\n    df_proc[\"label_sentimen\"] = df_proc.apply(lambda r: \"Negatif\" if r[\"inset_score\"] < 0 or (r[\"rating_bintang\"] <= 2 and r[\"inset_score\"] <= 0) else \"Positif\", axis=1)\n    \n    df_proc.to_csv(\"data/final_processed_absa_spbe.csv\", index=False)\n    print(\"✅ Processed dataset disimpan ke `data/final_processed_absa_spbe.csv`\")\n    \n    device = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\")\n    tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(MODEL_NAME)\n    \n    df_proc[\"numeric_label\"] = df_proc[\"label_sentimen\"].map(LABEL_MAP)\n    df_clean = df_proc.dropna(subset=[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\", \"numeric_label\"])\n    \n    X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n        df_clean[\"teks_ulasan_bersih\"].values,\n        df_clean[\"numeric_label\"].values.astype(int),\n        test_size=0.20,\n        random_state=42,\n        stratify=df_clean[\"numeric_label\"].values\n    )\n    \n    train_dataset = ReviewDataset(X_train, y_train, tokenizer)\n    test_dataset = ReviewDataset(X_test, y_test, tokenizer)\n    \n    train_loader = DataLoader(train_dataset, batch_size=16, shuffle=True)\n    test_loader = DataLoader(test_dataset, batch_size=16, shuffle=False)\n    \n    # Class Weights\n    class_counts = np.bincount(y_train)\n    class_weights = len(y_train) / (len(class_counts) * class_counts)\n    class_weights_tensor = torch.tensor(class_weights, dtype=torch.float).to(device)\n    \n    model = AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(MODEL_NAME, num_labels=2, ignore_mismatched_sizes=True)\n    model.to(device)\n    \n    criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss(weight=class_weights_tensor)\n    optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=2e-5)\n    \n    patience = 2\n    early_stopping = EarlyStopping(patience=patience)\n    epochs = 5\n    \n    print(f\"--- Memulai Training IndoBERT dengan Early Stopping (Max Epochs: {epochs}, Patience: {patience}) ---\")\n    for epoch in range(epochs):\n        model.train()\n        total_loss = 0\n        for step, batch in enumerate(train_loader):\n            input_ids = batch[\"input_ids\"].to(device)\n            attention_mask = batch[\"attention_mask\"].to(device)\n            labels = batch[\"labels\"].to(device)\n            \n            optimizer.zero_grad()\n            outputs = model(input_ids=input_ids, attention_mask=attention_mask)\n            loss = criterion(outputs.logits, labels)\n            loss.backward()\n            optimizer.step()\n            total_loss += loss.item()\n            \n            if (step+1) % 100 == 0:\n                print(f\"Epoch {epoch+1}/{epochs} | Step {step+1}/{len(train_loader)} | Train Loss: {loss.item():.4f}\")\n        \n        avg_train_loss = total_loss / len(train_loader)\n        \n        # Validation Loss\n        model.eval()\n        val_loss = 0.0\n        with torch.no_grad():\n            for batch in test_loader:\n                input_ids = batch[\"input_ids\"].to(device)\n                attention_mask = batch[\"attention_mask\"].to(device)\n                labels = batch[\"labels\"].to(device)\n                outputs = model(input_ids=input_ids, attention_mask=attention_mask)\n                loss = criterion(outputs.logits, labels)\n                val_loss += loss.item()\n        val_loss /= len(test_loader)\n        \n        print(f\"--> Epoch {epoch+1} Selesai. Train Loss: {avg_train_loss:.4f} | Val Loss: {val_loss:.4f}\")\n        \n        if early_stopping(val_loss):\n            print(f\"    ✨ [Best Model Checkpoint] Val Loss membaik ke {val_loss:.4f}. Menyimpan model...\")\n            os.makedirs(SAVE_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n            model.save_pretrained(SAVE_DIR)\n            tokenizer.save_pretrained(SAVE_DIR)\n            \n        if early_stopping.early_stop:\n            print(f\"🛑 EARLY STOPPING DIPICU! Pelatihan dihentikan pada Epoch {epoch+1}.\")\n            break\n            \n    print(f\"✅ Model IndoBERT PyTorch berhasil disimpan di `{SAVE_DIR}`\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.989383Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.989764Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-16T15:07:50.389605Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-16T14:52:37.989722Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-16T15:07:50.3